# Rebase branch

If the user says **rebase branch** (or rebase la branche / safe rebase / rebase onto main), follow `.cursor/skills/rebase-branch/SKILL.md`: fetch `origin/main`, classify this-branch vs incoming vs overlap, rebase without dropping either side, run pre-push CI, then `--force-with-lease`.
